Gottfried Herold: I mean.

52
00:16:04.700 --> 00:16:17.790
Gottfried Herold: I mean, secret sharing is… by secret sharing is sort of relevant here. I mean, the problem is that this is threshold encryption, or threshold decryption, which is a completely different beast to threshold signing and the like we need.

53
00:16:18.250 --> 00:16:20.989
Gottfried Herold: It's kind of a very different cryptographic primitive.

54
00:16:22.510 --> 00:16:24.640
Gottfried Herold: Regarding the PQ status…

55
00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:25.930
Justin Florentine: Okay.

56
